
ActiveMatrix is installed. Next:

  1. bin/rails db:migrate

  2. Secrets, for both the daemon and Rails:
       export ACTIVEMATRIX_MASTER_KEY=$(bundle exec activematrix keygen)
       export ACTIVEMATRIX_DELIVERY_SECRET=$(openssl rand -hex 32)

  3. A bot and an agent to run it:
       bin/rails generate active_matrix:bot greeter
       bin/rails runner "ActiveMatrix::Agent.create!(name: 'greeter', bot_class: 'GreeterBot',
                                                      homeserver_url: 'https://matrix.example.org')"
       bundle exec activematrix login greeter

  4. The daemon, next to your web and job processes:
       bundle exec activematrix start

  Schedule ActiveMatrix::MemoryReaperJob (e.g. hourly in config/recurring.yml)
  to prune expired memories and old inbox and outbox rows.

